    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><br>Take on the role of a Rift Guardian and maintain the balance between dimensions while facing deadly enemies. Grow stronger with each playthrough and prove your worth in this unstable multiverse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Auto-firing skills by default with a manual aiming option</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast runs (starting from 10 minutes)</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Currently, we have one class, the mage.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dozens of skills and three unique sub-classes for each Guardian, e.g., Mage (Arcane, Fire, Frost).</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Three permanent talent trees for each Guardian</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gather ores and essences to enhance your Guardian permanently</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete missions to advance in the rifts and defeat challenging bosses with unique and permanent rewards</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><br>Take on the role of a Rift Guardian and maintain the balance between dimensions while facing deadly enemies. Grow stronger with each playthrough and prove your worth in this unstable multiverse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Auto-firing skills by default with a manual aiming option</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast runs (starting from 10 minutes)</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Currently, we have one class, the mage.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dozens of skills and three unique sub-classes for each Guardian, e.g., Mage (Arcane, Fire, Frost).</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Three permanent talent trees for each Guardian</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gather ores and essences to enhance your Guardian permanently</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete missions to advance in the rifts and defeat challenging bosses with unique and permanent rewards</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Rift Survivors is a top-down action roguelite game. Take on the role of a Rift Guardian and maintain the balance between dimensions while facing deadly enemies. Grow stronger with each playthrough and prove your worth in this unstable multiverse.",
